/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:275:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:276:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:277:- The grid has a background, one full-edge marker line, and monochrome hollow 3x3 foreground symbols.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:278:- The symbols lie on a coarse row/column lattice; fully empty lattice rows or columns are absent from the output.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:279:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:280:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:281:- Replace each hollow 3x3 symbol with one pixel of its color in the corresponding coarse-grid cell.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:282:- The marker edge gives the compaction direction by clockwise border travel: top -> right, right -> down, bottom -> left, left -> up.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:283:- Preserve the order of non-background pixels while sliding them as far as possible in that direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:284:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:285:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:286:- The large picture is a scaled symbolic grid, and the blue edge marker acts as a gravity direction rather than as output content.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:287:</description>
