/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:291:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:292:Render the filled-square object counts as compact nested stacks ordered by count rank.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:293:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:294:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:295:A large noisy grid has a dominant background, scattered non-square noise, and
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:296:filled monochrome square objects. Each square side length has exactly one
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:297:object color, and side lengths form consecutive sizes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:298:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:299:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:300:Ignore non-square components. If the lowest square in the scene is of the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:301:smallest side length, treat that one smallest square as a distractor and do
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:302:not count it. For count rank k from left to right, create one block from all
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:303:square sizes with at least k remaining objects; draw larger squares first and
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:304:smaller squares over their upper-left corner, then append one background
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:305:separator column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:306:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:307:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:308:The output is a count histogram of square side lengths, but each histogram
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:309:slot is rendered as nested upper-left square masks using the side colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:310:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/17/prompt.md:311:</reference_puzzle>
